  "statement": "For the hash-pinned A1 production coefficients and A10-A13 sharp physical cubes, all prior A13 reductions remain binding at T4. R-088 audits the exact R-084 root-diagonal OU target and proves that it has no outer 2^j, so direct nonorthogonal Schur needs only s>0 and the unweighted sum_k q_k; at s=eta=7/12 the balanced constant is 16.30295538482827... with gap 2^(-7C/6). Sequential physical-shell secants give an exact three-channel Cartan atom whose kth coefficient path has no later control shells, and a quartic Besov lemma pays ||A||_H2 ||A||_6^3 for 0<s<1. The production sequential secant-to-quartic bridge or direct integrated CFAR remains open. On the rational branch, the K_eta square, transformed Wick term, and eta debt obey an exact three-term null identity; retained-square variance cancels the debt only on centered covariance-matched predictable blocks. A conditional theorem isolates mean/covariance defects, and the PSD matrix-fractional Jensen defect has no fixed Wick sign. Standalone debt and separate nonlinear heat transport are method no-gos. R-087's fixed-cutoff variational CORE remains binding. The same-root rational causal packet, REG, uniform OVERLAP, controlled-shell one-use, q=10/9 Nelson, and Sector A remain open.",
